### Install

```
curl -fsSL https://antigravity.google/cli/install.sh | bash
```

### Paseo

1. 下载 Google 官方 Antigravity ACP 内核发布包

```bash
mkdir -p ~/.local/opt
cd ~/.local/opt

curl -fsSL https://dl.google.com/agy-extensions/releases/linux/agy-acp-server-agy_acp_server_20260818_01_RC01-linux-x86_64.zip -o agy-acp-server.zip
unzip agy-acp-server.zip
chmod +x ~/.local/opt/agy_acp_server.par ~/.local/opt/localharness_external
```

2. 完成内核的 Google 账号登录授权

``` bash
export PASEO_AGY_ACP_OFFICIAL_BIN="$HOME/.local/opt/agy_acp_server.par"
npx -y paseo-agy-acp --login
```

3. 修改 Paseo 配置文件 `~/.paseo/config.json`

注意修改 `USERNAME` 和代理

``` json
{
  "version": 1,
  "agents": {
    "providers": {
      "antigravity": {
        "extends": "acp",
        "label": "Google Antigravity",
        "description": "Antigravity CLI coding agent via ACP adapter",
        "command": ["npx", "-y", "paseo-agy-acp"],
        "env": {
          "PASEO_AGY_ACP_OFFICIAL_BIN": "/home/<USERNAME>/.local/opt/agy_acp_server.par",
          "http_proxy": "http://127.0.0.1:7890",
          "https_proxy": "http://127.0.0.1:7890",
          "HTTP_PROXY": "http://127.0.0.1:7890",
          "HTTPS_PROXY": "http://127.0.0.1:7890",
          "all_proxy": "socks5://127.0.0.1:7890",
          "ALL_PROXY": "socks5://127.0.0.1:7890",
          "no_proxy": "localhost,127.0.0.1,::1",
          "NO_PROXY": "localhost,127.0.0.1,::1"
        },
        "params": {
          "supportsMcpServers": false
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

4. 重载 Paseo 并验证状态

``` bash
paseo reload
paseo provider ls
paseo provider diagnostic antigravity
```

5. 运行 Paseo 服务

``` bash
paseo daemon pair
```
